{
  "name": "dsh-sidebar-compact",
  "description": "侧栏精简（DSH Desktop 配套插件）：把面板组（插件商店/任务看板/智能体/更多）折叠成一行可展开的折叠头；手机端隐藏工具箱与手机访问；隐藏 DS Bot 工作区行；窄屏强制经典 Agent 模式。纯客户端（浏览器半边注入 CSS+DOS 操作），宿主半边 no-op，桌面壳与手机浏览器同样生效。",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": []
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "*"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "files": [
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "lib",
    "package.json"
  ]
}
